        },
        {
          "text": "x + x + x + x",
          "correct": 0,
          "catches": "ALG-ADD-COEFFICIENT"
        },
        {
          "text": "4 × x",
          "correct": 0,
          "catches": "ALG-ADD-COEFFICIENT"
        },
        {
          "text": "x × 4",
          "correct": 0,
          "catches": "ALG-ADD-COEFFICIENT"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "4x means four lots of x, so x + x + x + x, 4 × x and x × 4 all equal it. 4 + x adds 4 to x: if x = 3, then 4x is 12 but 4 + x is 7.",
